# Build and test artifacts.
#
# This file also decides what an sdist carries. hatchling locates a .gitignore
# by walking up from the project until it reaches .git, force-includes whichever
# one it found, and consults no setting that can stop it. Keeping this one
# accurate is therefore part of packaging, not just of local tidiness.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
